    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not an illusion though. it's literally my reality. i see the way people look right through me or the way they just stop talking when i enter a room. it's not like i can just 'reach out' and fix it. once you've been cast out like this, you're done. there's no version of my life where i'm part of something again. i've already lost my place in the world.",
